# hsk py check

After completing code changes, before each `hsk py check` run `hsk py ruff-sort-docs` first.

Run `hsk py ruff`, then `hsk py ruff-sort-docs`, then `hsk py check` and fix until it passes.
Repeat this cycle up to **3 times maximum**. If it still fails after 3 iterations, stop and report the remaining errors.

Do not finish while `hsk py check` still fails, unless the failure is environmental and cannot be fixed in code.

## Cross-project check

The following projects are linked:

- `harrix-swiss-knife`
- `harrix-pylib`
- `harrix-pyssg`

If changes are made to **any** of these projects, for **every** project from the list above (not just the one that was modified):

- run `hsk py ruff-sort-docs`
- run `hsk py check`

Fix all errors in each of them before finishing. Repeat the cycle up to **3 times maximum** per project.

Do not finish until `hsk py check` passes in all listed projects, unless a failure is environmental and cannot be fixed in code.
